From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:06:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: apply the generated icon set

android_icons carries a proper asset set (launcher, round, foreground,
monochrome, gradient background, notification icon), so the hand-cut
mipmaps are replaced with it. The launcher adapts with a monochrome
layer, notifications get the white ball as their small icon, and the
tele settings row icon shrinks a step. The root tele settings rows drop
the coloured circles for plain line icons, matching inner settings
screens.

Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
